          "title": "CAP and PACELC Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. CAP: CP vs AP",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Under a ==partition==, pick {blue:Consistency} (reads see the latest write) or {green:Availability} (every live node answers)",
                "Partitions are unavoidable, so the real choice is ==CP vs AP==",
                "Partition heals: AP sides reconcile"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "CP",
                "AP"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Examples",
                  "etcd, ZooKeeper, HBase",
                  "Cassandra, DynamoDB default, Riak"
                ],
                [
                  "Minority side",
                  "Rejects requests or errors",
                  "Keeps serving"
                ],
                [
                  "Both sides",
                  "Only majority is correct",
                  "Diverge, then reconcile"
                ],
                [
                  "Trade",
                  "Correct, may refuse",
                  "Always answers, may be stale"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. PACELC",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flowchart",
              "spec": {
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "q1"
                  ],
                  [
                    "a",
                    "b"
                  ]
                ],
                "nodes": {
                  "q1": {
                    "text": "Partition?",
                    "shape": "diamond"
                  },
                  "a": {
                    "text": "P: choose A or C",
                    "shape": "box",
                    "ink": "red"
                  },
                  "b": {
                    "text": "Else: choose Latency or Consistency",
                    "shape": "box",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                },
                "edges": [
                  {
                    "from": "q1",
                    "to": "a",
                    "label": "yes"
                  },
                  {
                    "from": "q1",
                    "to": "b",
                    "label": "no"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Healthy systems still trade ==speed for freshness==",
                "Fresher reads cost cross-node coordination"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "'Pick 2 of 3' is wrong",
                "==CA== is not a real option for a distributed system",
                "CAP says nothing about behavior with no partition"
